            "text": "{\"data\":[{\"key\":\"search\",\"signature\":{\"tool\":\"Browser\",\"action\":\"search\",\"signature\":[]},\"dependencies\":[],\"tool\":\"Browser\",\"toolDisplayName\":\"Web browser\",\"actionKey\":\"search\",\"displayName\":\"Search the Internet\",\"description\":\"Search the Internet using a variety of search engines.\",\"hasSideEffects\":false,\"inputSchema\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"query\"],\"properties\":{\"query\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"The search query.\"},\"engineOptions\":{\"anyOf\":[{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"engine\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"const\":\"bing\"},\"location\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"e.g San Francisco, CA\"}},\"required\":[\"engine\"],\"additionalProperties\":false,\"lindyMetadata\":{\"displayName\":\"Bing\"}},{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"engine\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"const\":\"events\"},\"location\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"e.g San Francisco, CA\"}},\"required\":[\"engine\"],\"additionalProperties\":false,\"lindyMetadata\":{\"displayName\":\"Events\"}},{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"engine\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"const\":\"images\"},\"location\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"e.g San Francisco, CA\"}},\"required\":[\"engine\"],\"additionalProperties\":false,\"lindyMetadata\":{\"displayName\":\"Images\"}},{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"engine\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"const\":\"jobs\"},\"location\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"e.g San Francisco, CA\"}},\"required\":[\"engine\"],\"additionalProperties\":false,\"lindyMetadata\":{\"displayName\":\"Jobs\"}},{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"engine\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"const\":\"news\"},\"gl\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"Parameter defines the country to use for the Google News search. It's a two-letter country code. (e.g., us for the United States (default), uk for United Kingdom, or fr for France). Head to the [Google countries page](https://ser